; The names the title resolves from xgameruntime.dll: the GDK bootstrap it finds
; with GetProcAddress (QueryApiImpl, InitializeApiImpl/Ex/Ex2, UninitializeApiImpl,
; XErrorReport) and the XGame* strings in the image. Nothing else is invented:
; the reference HLE runtimes implement a large GDK surface, but this title names
; only these, and an export nobody calls is a guess.
EXPORTS
    InitializeApiImpl
    InitializeApiImplEx
    InitializeApiImplEx2
    QueryApiImpl
    UninitializeApiImpl
    XErrorReport
    XGameRuntimeInitialize
    XGameUiShowPlayerProfileCardAsync
    XGameUiShowTextEntryAsync
